{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>青衣青沙公路有私家車起火，無人受傷。</p><p></p><p>網上片段可見，一輛私家車著火，火勢猛烈、冒出濃煙。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.CARFIRE-0100_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026dysIIBkzTF1791674760.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>事發在昨晚約10時40分，私家車沿青沙公路向九龍行駛，駛至八號貨櫃碼頭對開突然起火，司機報警。消防接報後到場將火救熄，私家車嚴重焚毀。警員向司機問話，起火原因仍在調查。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.CARFIRE-0100_003.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026QH1nokbiOK1791674756.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-10T23:58:06.762562+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":129,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}